  epo:usesTechnique <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/cc427905-9ea2-46c3-af50-972a9dc4c133-01/AuctionTerms$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot5_TenderingProcess1_AuctionTerms1>,
